<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span><h1>Shop Ledger KH Privacy Policy</h1><p>Pre-release privacy information for Shop Ledger KH.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose"><p><strong>Last updated: August 20, 2026</strong></p><p><strong>Status: Pre-release draft.</strong> This policy will be reviewed against the final app implementation before publication on Google Play.</p><h2>1. Scope</h2><p>This Privacy Policy applies to Shop Ledger KH, a Kroma Digital application for small-business record management.</p><h2>2. Data handling</h2><p>The final data-handling behavior will depend on the released version of the app. Before release, Kroma Digital will verify whether the app stores business records only on the device or also uses cloud services, analytics, crash reporting, advertising, billing, or other third-party SDKs.</p><h2>3. Permissions</h2><p>Any Android permissions requested by the released app will be limited to functions required by its features and will be documented here before public release.</p><h2>4. Third-party services</h2><p>If third-party services are included, such as Google Play Billing, analytics, crash reporting, advertising, or cloud infrastructure, this policy will identify them and explain their role before release.</p><h2>5. Data retention and deletion</h2><p>The final release policy will describe where user data is stored, how long it is retained, and how users can delete data or request deletion where applicable.</p><h2>6. Security</h2><p>Kroma Digital will use reasonable technical and organizational measures appropriate to the final implementation of the app.</p><h2>7. Changes</h2><p>This pre-release policy may change as development continues. The version published at this URL at the time of release will reflect the final app behavior.</p><h2>8. Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions can be sent through the Kroma Digital Facebook page linked on our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>